SUMMARY:Mean Girls
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:In this pop culture phenomenon\, Lindsay Lohan’s zoologist pa
 rents bring the family back from Africa and enroll their daughter in the w
 ilds of an average American High School. There\, Cady finds herself involv
 ed with “The Plastics”—a group of shallow mean girls under the comma
 nd of cruel Regina George (Rachel McAdams). What follows is a treasure tro
 ve of sharp\, witty humor that defined a generation\, inspired a hit Broad
 way musical\, and popularized countless catchphrases (we know\, that’s s
 o fetch!). Co-Starring and written by Tina Fey\, and featuring Amanda Seyf
 ried\, Lacey Chabert\, Lizzy Caplan\, Daniel Franzese\, and Amy Poehler.\n
